  PySDD (optional)       Apache-2.0     — SDD compilation
  RDFLib (optional)      BSD-3-Clause   — independent SPARQL oracle / native factoring
  tqdm (optional)        MPL-2.0 / MIT  — progress reporting in extended experiments
